QuestBookGuideLead: {
	// WelcomeTitle: This Book
	// WelcomeLine1: Two things lie open in here: the quest chart and the commission dossier.
	// WelcomeLine2: The chart records how far the main story has come; the dossier collects the jobs others have entrusted to you.
	// RailTitle: The Two Tabs on the Left
	// RailLine1: The upper one turns to the Quest Chart.
	// RailLine2: The lower one turns to the Commission Dossier.
	// RailLine3: Click a tab to switch stations. No need to close the book.
	// RailAct: Click the upper tab to turn to the Quest Chart.
	// ChartViewTitle: Reading the Chart
	// ChartViewLine1: Scroll to zoom, hold Left-click to drag and pan.
	// ChartViewLine2: If the view wanders off, the Recenter key at the bottom right brings it back.
	// ChartViewAct: Try a scroll, or drag the chart a little.
	// ChartNodeTitle: Open a Node
	// ChartNodeLine1: The mark on a node is its state: hatching for not started, an ink ring for underway, a wax seal for a reward waiting, a cracked seal for closed.
	// ChartNodeAct: Left-click the one circled here.
	// ChartDetailTitle: The Slip on the Right
	// ChartDetailLine1: The upper half is what this chapter asks of you; the lower half is what it pays.
	// ChartDetailLine2: Claim All at the bottom collects every reward from closed chapters at once.
	// OutroTitle: The Dossier Is Still Empty
	// OutroLine1: As the story moves along, people will leave work at this station.
	// OutroLine2: This guide will pick up again when your first commission arrives.
	// KeyPromptTitle: Someone Left You a Job
	// KeyPromptLine1: The first commission is filed in the dossier. Go take a look.
	// KeyPromptBound: Press [{0}] to open the quest book.
	// KeyPromptUnboundTitle: The Quest Book Hotkey Is Unbound
	// KeyPromptUnboundLine: "[{0}] is the default, and it still works right now."
	// KeyPromptBindHint: To rebind it, go to Settings → Controls.
	// GotoTitle: Turn to the Dossier
	// GotoLine1: The book remembers which station you left it on and opens there next time.
	// GotoAct: Click the lower tab on the left.
	// AnatomyTitle: One Commission
	// AnatomyLine1: The round stamp on the left is the client, the middle holds the title and progress, the right shows its current state.
	// AnatomyLine2: Expanding it shows the body text, progress and signature.
	// AnatomyAct: Left-click this row to open it up.
	// TrackTitle: Track It
	// TrackLine1: Tracked commissions get pinned to the tracker on the left of the screen, readable without opening the book.
	// TrackAct: Right-click this row  →  track.
	// TrackAltLine1: This row was tracked automatically the moment it was filed, and it is already pinned to the tracker on the left of the screen.
	// TrackAltAct: Right-click this row to untrack it, then right-click again to pin it back.
	// TrackerTitle: The Tracker
	// TrackerLine1: This column keeps every tracked commission on screen.
	// TrackerLine2: Hold Left-click and drag up or down to move it.
	// TrackerLine3: It folds away on its own when the quest book opens, so it never covers the page.
	// SuspendTitle: Suspending and Sorting
	// SuspendLine1: Middle-click a row  →  suspend, and it drops out of the tracker.
	// SuspendLine2: The four tabs up top hold Active / All / Completed / Suspended. Suspended ones go in the last.
	// SuspendLine3: Find it there and middle-click once more, and it goes back where it was.
	// BtnConfirm: Understood
	// BtnNext: Next
	// BtnSkipStep: Skip this step
	// BtnDismiss: Put the guide away
	// BtnOpenBook: Just open it
	// HelpButtonHover: Replay the quest book guide
}

